title: Neuronal Data Analyzer Lab
message: >-
  If you use this software, or results produced with it, in work that you
  publish or present, you must cite it using the metadata below (citation
  condition in LICENSE.txt).
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Alejandro
    family-names: Suarez
    email: alesr713@gmail.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0931-8512"
repository-code: "https://github.com/alesuarez92/NeuronalDataAnalyzerLab"
url: "https://neuroanalyzerlab.com"
abstract: >-
  Neuroscience analysis toolbox for Laser Doppler Flowmetry, electrophysiology
  (LFP, MUA), ROI / coregistered image analysis (brightness, movement, ΔF/F,
  blood-flow speed, kymograph, vessel diameter), and signal characterization
  (peak latency, onset delay, FWHM, AUC, rise/decay time, stimulation–response
  integration). MATLAB.
keywords:
  - neuroscience
  - electrophysiology
  - laser-doppler-flowmetry
  - calcium-imaging
  - lfp
  - mua
  - signal-processing
  - matlab
